{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed data for LEARNO_MODE=sandbox. Loaded into the in-memory store at boot;",
    "every change made while clicking around is discarded on restart, so the",
    "sandbox always starts from this exact state.",
    "",
    "Dates are written as { \"$daysFromNow\": N } and resolved at load time, so a",
    "concept seeded as due-today stays due today forever instead of rotting.",
    "",
    "The set is deliberately shaped to exercise every dashboard branch at once:",
    "mastered / not mastered, overdue / due today / scheduled ahead, a concept",
    "mastered by conversation rather than by a lesson, and a lesson with mixed",
    "per-section scores including a recorded misconception.",
    "",
    "One misconception is seeded THREE times, spelled differently each time and",
    "across two lessons: it is what proves the grouping on /api/progress collapses",
    "wording and that the dashboard only promotes a mistake once it repeats."
  ],
